current execution environment does not have ansible collection installed so we need to follow these steps

1- create another directory in /awx-operator
mkdir custom-ee
cd custom-ee
 nano Dockerfile
FROM quay.io/ansible/awx-ee:24.6.0

# Install Python and pip
USER root
RUN yum install -y python3 python3-pip

# Install Ansible
RUN pip3 install ansible

# Install the cisco.ios collection
RUN ansible-galaxy collection install cisco.ios


docker build -t my-custom-awx-ee:latest
docker login
docker tag my-custom-awx-ee:latest your-docker-hub-username/my-custom-awx-ee:latest
docker push your-docker-hub-username/my-custom-awx-ee:latest
once done create a new execution environment and use the environment in all projects and files
